# Scene 3: the command bar. Cmd-T, a few letters, and the bar offers the open
# Wikipedia tab of another Space (the article on HTTP cookies); Enter goes there, and the sidebar slides to
# Personal, the Space with its own session. Typed in two bursts, as a person types.
# The bar opening is also what record-demo.sh syncs the recording's clock on.
shot @MARKS@/bar.png
key t+cmd
wait 0.6
type http
wait 0.2
type  cookie
wait 0.9
key down
wait 0.4
key enter
wait 1.6
